ghostlight (1.3.11) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Negotiate truthful browser capabilities from executable adapter handlers.
  * Install one acknowledged, checksum-bound page runtime across Chromium documents.
  * Remove raw browser escape hatches and every runnable headless test path.
  * Execute form fills as one deadline-bound physical transaction.
  * Remove the partial Firefox adapter from the browser offering.

